  "measurements": [
    "Native pg_catalog.version() supplies the exact build identity and the full census selects its declared stock layout.",
    "Record the four actual heap-TOAST-index edges before and after each comparison. Each allowed build still has an exact expected catalog, including the decoded physical index names, owner OIDs and valid/shared fields.",
    "Compare physical identity and files within the same fixture and retain the mandatory mutation witnesses, observations, finite enumerations, seeds and budgets. Reject any unregistered build or additional stock difference."
  ],
  "calibration": "Four disposable pinned native images measured by architecture and exact release. The explicit bootstrap database and the fresh template0 copy had identical heap, TOAST and index identities on each build.",
